You have trained to be very light on your feet and have conditioned your reflexes to react faster than thought to damage you take.

While this talent is active, you instantly react to any direct damage (not from status effects, etc.) that would hit you for at least [33%, 24%, 19%, 16%, 15% (TL1-5)] of your maximum life.

This requires [2.7, 3.6, 4.1, 4.6, 5.0 (TL1-5)] stamina and reduces the damage by [10%, 18%, 23%, 27%, 29% (TL1-5; DEX 100; LUCK 100)].

Your reactions are too slow for this if you are wearing heavy armour.

The damage reduction improves with your Defense.
